		(property "Note" "IR gate series resistor. RETAINED at 100 R. It damps the gate loop and slows the edge to well under 100 ns, which is about 0.3 percent of the 26.3 us carrier period, so it costs no switching performance while reducing radiated EMI from the LED current loop."
			(at 175.26 35.56 0)
