		(property "Note" "IR gate pull-down. RETAINED at 100 k. This is the safe-OFF guarantee: with the AO3400A IGSS at most 100 nA the gate can only reach 10 mV, far below the 650 mV minimum threshold, so the LED cannot emit during boot, reset, GPIO high-impedance or a firmware crash."
