		(property "Note" "IR RECEIVER SUPPLY FILTER, shunt element. RETAINED at 4.7 uF after audit in FBV2-S1-007. With R21 100 R this gives a 339 Hz corner and 41 dB at the 38 kHz carrier, which is what keeps the transmitter out of the receiver front end - see the R21 note and datasheet Fig. 7. Do not reduce this value to save area without redoing that calculation."
			(at 154.94 71.12 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
